	START_NODE -> "enter purchase order details"
	END_NODE [label="" shape=doublecircle width=0.2]
	"AND_JOIN--4. Payment_G8AF" -> END_NODE
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following text is about the account payable process. It begins when you enter purchase order details. 
When entering purchase order details is completed, creating a receiving report should be done. 
Once creating a receiving report occurs, you need to confirm all documents have been amended.
When confirming all documents have been amended is completed, the next tasks should be scheduling the payment, stamping all documents and entering the invoice into the accounts payable account, they should be done in parallel. 
Once scheduling the payment occurs, you need to check dates to avoid penalty charges.
When stamping all documents is completed, creating voucher for the documents should be done. 
The process is now completed. 
"
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following text is about the account payable process which begins when you enter the details of your purchase order.
When purchase order details are completed, a receipt should be created.
Once the creation of a receiving report occurs, you need to verify that all documents have been amended.
When all documentation has been changed, the next task should be the balances, the stamping of all documents and entering the invoice to the accounts payable account - they should be done in parallel.
Once the payment occurs you have to check the dates to avoid penalty charges.
When stamping all documents is completed, creating the voucher for the documents should be done.
The process is now complete.
"
}
